
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Claymore Manor - The Maids.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Claymore Manor - The Maids.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"6jrp23","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777016026584,"size":2403,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"6jrp23"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,22],"#Locations - Claymore Manor - The Maids":[24,25],"#The collective identity and behavior of the maids at Claymore Manor.":[26,36],"#The collective identity and behavior of the maids at Claymore Manor.#{1}":[27,36]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":100,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["maids","servants","staff","uniform","claire","priti","fiona"],"position":"before","cascade_links":["Claymore Manor"],"depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What this is:** A collective entry defining the Maids of Claymore Manor as a mischievous group, their standard skimpy uniforms, role as personal attendants (not general house cleaners), and core members: ringleader Claire (instigator, not genuinely lewd), strict beautician Priti, and timid Fiona (secret masochist).\n\n**When to select:** When describing a maid’s behavior, uniform, or general interaction with {{user}} or their mistresses. Use for any scene involving daily service, baths, teasing, or conflict among the maids.\n\n**Key relationships:** Serve {{user}} as master; role for specific mistresses; Claire antagonizes/reases {{user}} for reactions; Priti is Claire’s foil; Fiona is subordinate/timid."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Claymore Manor - The Maids.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1m66sxv","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/